<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38875" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίβαθρον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fare of an</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιβάτης</span>, <i>passenger's
			fare</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καὶ δέ κεν ἄλλ᾽</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ . . . δοίην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					15.449
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				1.96
			</span></i>; so of <i><span class="en">
				Charon
			</span></i>'s <i>fare</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεὼς Ἀχεροντείας</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				110
			</span></i>: generally, <i>rent, payment for</i> anything, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.727f
				</span></i>
			; <i>toll</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Del.</u>
				22
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἐ.</span>, of a sacrifice,
			regarded as a <i>fare</i> paid on embarking, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.421
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ὀρνίθων</span>”
				<i>roosting-place, perch,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					AP
					9.661
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Jul.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἀοιδῆς</span>
			<i>stool</i> for a singer, ib.<i><span class="en">
				140
			</span></i> (Claud.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLond.</u>
				1821.283
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>.
			= foreg. <i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				2.171.27
			</span></i> (pl., dub., <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>).</div>
